flowchart LR
  client[API client] --> gateway[API gateway]
  gateway --> auth[OIDC/API-key verifier]
  auth --> tenant[Tenant and domain service]
  tenant --> policy[Policy and quota]
  tenant --> audit[Audit service]
  tenant --> pg[(PostgreSQL)]
  policy --> snapshot[Signed policy snapshot]
  snapshot --> data[Data-plane cache/lease]
  tenant -->|configuration events| outbox[(Outbox)]
  outbox --> data
